---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Stories
metaTitle: Web Stories · Daily Insight Desk
description: Short portrait stories from Daily Insight Desk. Each one leads to the full home and garden guide, with no product links inside the story.
section: stories
date: 2026-11-18
updated: 2026-11-18
permalink: /stories/
---
<main id="main" class="wrap page-hero">
  <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
    <ol>
      <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
      <li aria-current="page">Stories</li>
    </ol>
  </nav>
  <p class="eyebrow">Web Stories</p>
  <h1>Stories</h1>
  <p class="dek">A short, full-screen version of a guide. The last page opens the article. Stories do not contain product links.</p>
  <div class="story-grid">
    {% for guide in collections.storyGuides %}
    <a class="story-card" href="/stories/{{ guide.data.story.slug }}/">
      <img src="/assets/images/stories/{{ guide.data.story.slug }}.webp" alt="" width="720" height="960" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
      <span>{{ guide.data.title }}</span>
    </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</main>
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  "itemListElement": [
    { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "{{ site.url }}/" },
    { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Stories", "item": "{{ site.url }}/stories/" }
  ]
}
</script>
